Package: captcha
Title: Professional Anti-AI Resistant Captcha Solution
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person('Julio', 'Trecenti',
             email = 'julio.trecenti@gmail.com',
             role = c('cre', 'aut'),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1680-6389")))
Description: Professional-grade captcha generation system with advanced
  anti-AI features including adversarial noise, 3D transforms, semantic elements,
  token-based validation, rate limiting, and multi-modal verification. Designed
  to resist automated solving by neural networks while remaining human-solvable.
  Includes comprehensive security features with cryptographic tokens, session
  management, behavioral analysis, and progressive difficulty scaling.
